@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api

### Current runtime navigation
### Expected: MAIN_NAVIGATION, SIDEBAR layout from DEFAULT_THEME, Asset Management page targets linked
GET {{baseUrl}}/navigation/current
x-tenant-id: demo
x-domain-code: DEFAULT
x-application-code: ASSET_MAINTENANCE
x-user-id: designer
x-permissions: ASSET.READ,WORK_ORDER.READ,TICKET.READ

