### Navigation designer draft
POST {{baseUrl}}/designer/drafts
x-tenant-id: demo
x-domain-code: DEFAULT
x-application-code: ASSET_MAINTENANCE
x-user-id: designer
x-permissions: FORM.DESIGN,FORM.PUBLISH
content-type: application/json

{
  "targetType": "NAVIGATION",
  "targetCode": "MAIN_NAVIGATION"
}

### Add menu item to navigation draft
POST {{baseUrl}}/designer/replace-with-navigation-draft-id/operations
x-tenant-id: demo
x-domain-code: DEFAULT
x-application-code: ASSET_MAINTENANCE
x-user-id: designer
x-permissions: FORM.DESIGN,FORM.PUBLISH
content-type: application/json

{
  "type": "ADD_MENU",
  "payload": {
    "parentCode": "ASSET_MANAGEMENT",
    "code": "WORK_ORDER_FAST_LINK",
    "label": "Work Order Fast Link",
    "icon": "bolt",
    "order": 3,
    "target": {
      "type": "PAGE",
      "code": "WORK_ORDER_DETAIL_PAGE"
    },
    "visibleWhen": {
      "permissions": ["WORK_ORDER.READ"]
    }
  }
}

### Preview navigation draft
POST {{baseUrl}}/designer/replace-with-navigation-draft-id/preview
